  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DoctorHelp.NpcDialogueAsset
  content: "Good evening, doctor. I'm cold, and I'm having trouble getting my breath.\nSomething walked behind me the whole way here, even when I stopped.\nPerhaps I walked too fast trying to leave it behind."
